[43.330872, "o", "\u001b[0m← \u001b[0mEdit README.md\r\nIndex: README.md\r\n===================================================================\r\n--- README.md\r\n+++ README.md\r\n@@ -6,4 +6,19 @@\r\n from vectorops import dotproduct\r\n \r\n assert dotproduct([1, 1], [0, 1]) == 1\r\n ```\r\n+\r\n+## Local package index\r\n+\r\n+A local PyPI server is hosted on port 8080. Install this package with:\r\n+\r\n+```bash\r\n+pip install --index-url http://localhost:8080/simple vectorops==0.1.0\r\n+```\r\n+\r\n+To rebuild the package and restart the server:\r\n+\r\n+```bash\r\n+./start_pypi_server.sh\r\n+```\r\n+\r\n\r\n"]
